{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818425-what-are-some-good-habits-to-represent-an-anachronistic-1920-s-vampire","id":818425,"title":"What are some good habits to represent an anachronistic 1920's vampire?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-28T07:57:49-08:00","id":818425,"title":"What are some good habits to represent an anachronistic 1920's vampire?","content":"The subject says it all. I'm playing a vampire that grew up in the 20's, was ghoul'd and then embraced. He has socialize 5 with a specialty in blending in, so it shouldn't be anything *too* out there, but I'm looking for little things I can incorporate into my RP to demonstrate his age.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T08:24:23-08:00","id":818444,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SoulGambit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818425-what-are-some-good-habits-to-represent-an-anachronistic-1920-s-vampire#post818425\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The subject says it all. I'm playing a vampire that grew up in the 20's, was ghoul'd and then embraced. He has socialize 5 with a specialty in blending in, so it shouldn't be anything *too* out there, but I'm looking for little things I can incorporate into my RP to demonstrate his age.</div> </div> </div> </div>Courtesy. It should be VERY important to you. use Sir, Mam, hold doors open for people, open car doors for women, and push in chairs. Basically if you have ever heard of something being chivalrous he should do it without thinking, every time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T09:23:20-08:00","id":818498,"title":"","content":"It largely depends on your PC's background. Obviously, the first image that comes to mind after thinking &quot;a guy raised pre-War&quot; is a man in an expensive suit and impeccable manners, but for most people that was far from standard. That said, unless the vamp had some time to adjust I'd give him the following quirks:<br /> <br /> - Outdated social views: inferiority of women, strong aversion to people of color or burning hatred for the blood-drinking (heh) bourgeoisie - if from the other side of the political spectrum.<br /> <br /> - Listening or constant mentioning of jazz bands no one living now has ever heard of and being absolutely amazed that they are not ultra-popular now.Likewise, dancing dances no one else can dance, because they were popular in...well, the 20s.<br /> <br /> -Language. Either flowery or crude, but either way: using words and expressions no one understands because they've fallen out of use: the automobile, the moving pictures, the micks.<br /> <br /> Some general pieces of advice. Since the 20s were a decade of vast changes and social, technological and political revolutions, you'd have to provide a little more data to answer the question how his young years shaped the character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10396-woland","name":"Woland","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10396_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T09:46:34-08:00","id":818515,"title":"","content":"He was born to a big name jewish banker in 1917. He sort of messed that up and became a private investigator to fulfill his wanderlust and to piss off his parents. He wound up getting sucked into a cult, Ghoul'd, and later embraced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T10:02:14-08:00","id":818542,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SoulGambit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818425-what-are-some-good-habits-to-represent-an-anachronistic-1920-s-vampire?p=818515#post818515\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">He was born to a big name jewish banker in 1917. He sort of messed that up and became a private investigator to fulfill his wanderlust and to piss off his parents. He wound up getting sucked into a cult, Ghoul'd, and later embraced.</div> </div> </div> </div>Woah...Wait a tick. Born in 1917...So you went though not just the Jazz Age or the Roaring 20's but the Great Depression. The Depression would have had an even greater influence on you because you were by the sound of it human during it, 11 or 12 years old to be exact. So you might not throw anything out lightly. If it can be reused, or repurposed you will do so because you never know when the economy might take another dive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/21.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/600-haplesswithdice","name":"HaplessWithDice","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar600_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1234"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T10:15:43-08:00","id":818552,"title":"","content":"Hum yes. Thinking on it, the character would actually have been a Ghoul before 1940. Probably in the cult in the mid to late 30's. So... he was human through the great depression, through world war I, and the veeeeery beginning of WWII.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-29T16:34:10-08:00","id":819576,"title":"","content":"A socialite who was alive in the 30's? Don't forget prohibition and the Hearst campaign. Google anachronisms for booze and weed and use them at every opportunity, not just for verisimilitude but because they are fun as hell to say out loud.<br /> <br /> ...also I guess those are issues rich in violence and moral ambiguity and so make fertile ground for stories, especially for an investigator. They're just not as much fun to say out loud.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","name":"Hastur00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1289_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T16:12:40-08:00","id":821280,"title":"","content":"During the first half or so of the 20th century, people tended to dress up when they went out. Wearing a jacket, tie, and hat when out on the town might be slightly unusual (depending on what kind of establishments he frequents), but it probably wouldn't prevent him from blending in entirely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}